0..57 Comment "//! A nominal binding port abstracts an atom over a term."
58..61 Comment "//!"
62..139 Comment "//! `bind (a : N) . T` abstracts an atom of atom sort `N` over a port of sort"
140..148 Comment "//! `T`."
149..152 Comment "//!"
153..219 Comment "//! A swap renames the atom. The atom can escape its binding port."
220..298 Comment "//! A `pi+` port binds a variable for substitution. Each `Theory` value stores"
299..375 Comment "//! an abstracting port as an `Abstracted` link. A program reads the link by"
376..387 Comment "//! `case`."
388..391 Comment "//!"
392..462 Comment "//! - cites: [Pitts-2013-nominal_sets_names_symmetry_computer_science]"
463..515 Comment "//! - cites: [Gabbay-2009-nominal_universal_algebra]"
516..519 Comment "//!"
